speechtext:
The four that have been taken care of under the regular vote are: L'Association Co-operative des Pecheurs de L'llle Ltee, Lameque, New Brunswick;
[Mr. Pickersgill.1
Alfred C. LeBlanc, Wedgeport, Nova Scotia; Wilbert Sears, Wood's Harbour, Nova Scotia; and Stoney Island Fisheries Limited, Cape Sable island, Nova Scotia. The ones awaiting payment are: Cartier Co-operative Limited, Richibucto, New Brunswick and Jean B. Godin, Maisonnette, New Brunswick.
